>> title: Focaccia
>> category: Breads
>> tags: bread, italian, olive oil, rosemary, oven
>> servings: 12
>> time: 20 hr
>> step.1: mix to a wet dough
>> step.2: cover, chill 18 hours
>> step.3: oil a 9x13-in pan, stretch dough in, rise 2 hours
>> step.4: dimple and top
>> step.5: bake 450°F 25 min

Mix @bread flour{4%cup}(500 g), @instant yeast{1%tsp}(3 g), @fine sea salt{2%tsp}(10 g), and @cool water{1 3/4%cup}(400 g).

Cover @&(~1)dough{} and refrigerate ~{18%hours}.

Turn @&(~1)dough{} into a #9x13-in pan{} coated with @extra-virgin olive oil{4%Tbs}(60 mL) and rise ~{2%hours}.

Dimple @&(~1)dough{} and top with @olive oil{2%Tbs}(30 mL), @chopped rosemary{1%Tbs}, and @flaky sea salt{1%tsp}.

Bake @&(~1)focaccia{} at 450°F for ~{25%min}.
